'''Checker''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that is obtainable by [[crafting]] it or through trading. 

== Appearance ==
The whole knife is covered in a black and pink checker pattern, hence the name.

== Trivia ==
*It is a reference to the missing texture used in the [https://developer.valvesoftware.com/wiki/Source Source engine]. 
*Its [https://www.roblox.com/library/162670721/SKIN-Missing-Knife texture] was designed by [https://www.roblox.com/users/15351949/profile mkargus]. 
*This is one of many knives that are found in other Murder games.
*Players can exchange 12 common [[shards]] through [[crafting]] to obtain it by chance.
*When salvaged, it provides 2 uncommon [[shards]].
*Its texture is bugged, causing the knife to appear solid white in color when equipped

